A quick release to fix an error making command line commands case insensitive. I ended up
converting all ASL passwords entered via the CLI to lower case!
Otherwise some suggested convenience features and more tinkering with experimental VCXO code
No change to the Users Guide compared to Rev 0.06.

* Changed factory default for local repeater mode to be "repeater", not off
* If a reboot is requested and there are unsaved settings, check with the user first.
* DAC8571 support for VCXO
* Fixed a programming error where dial passwords were being converted to all lower case
